CBI Gene summary (RefSeq), via MyGene.info","uniprot_function":[{"accession":"Q5VTY9","text":"Palmitoyl acyltransferase that catalyzes N-terminal palmitoylation of hedgehog (DHH, IHH or SHH) morphogens, promoting their maturation (PubMed:11486055, PubMed:18534984, PubMed:24784881, PubMed:31875564, PubMed:34112694, PubMed:34890564). Promotes the transfer of palmitoyl-CoA from the cytoplasmic to the luminal side of the endoplasmic reticulum membrane, where hedgehog palmitoylation occurs (PubMed:31875564, PubMed:34112694, PubMed:34890564). Required for hedgehog signaling during limb development (By similarity). Plays a role in proper testis cord formation and the differentiation of Leydig cells (PubMed:24784881)."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_04","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}